  "management_type_reason": "RHS・品種: 剪定不要。stauden.de・品種: 適地ではほぼ手入れ不要。おぎはら楽天の「花後に花茎を切る程度」は最小限の手入れとして A のまま（試作例のアルメリアと同じ扱い。これを花後と数えれば B）",
  "management_type_quote": "No pruning required",
  "management_type_by_matching": "A 放任型",
  "heat_west_only": "弱",
  "muggy_west_only": "弱",
  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[おぎはら/品種] 耐暑性；強\n[おぎはら楽天/品種] 日照 寒冷地: 日向〜明るい日陰／暖地: 日向〜やや半日陰（西日 ○ 相当）\n[MBG/品種] However, plants often struggle in the hot and humid summers of the deep South where they appreciate afternoon shade or sun dappled shade.\n[食い違い] 欧米の文献（品種の記述）は 弱 相当。おぎはら植物園の値を採った\n[RHS/品種] Aspect: North-facing or West-facing or East-facing",
  "spread_evidence": "[地下茎 1／MBG・品種] spread over time by short creeping rhizomes（読み直し）\n[こぼれ種 1／MBG・品種] Plants may self-seed in optimum growing conditions.（読み直し）\n[こぼれ種 1／MBG・品種] Plants may self-seed in optimum growing conditions.\n[地下茎 1／Walters・品種] Clumps slowly spread to form a small patch, which may be divided carefully in the spring every 4 years or so.\n[増え方] こぼれ種・地下茎の段階に合わせて直した（前：地下茎）",
  "mixing_evidence": "地下茎 0〜1（こぼれ種・地下茎の根拠の列）",
  "silhouette_evidence": "[Walters・品種] It forms a low mound of large, bold maple-shaped leaves, bronze-green in spring, later becoming deep green with stunning crimson tips.",
